title: The Vote
subtitle: The congress decides.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: congress = 1 and congress_closing = 1 and congress_own_close = 0
priority: 9
on-arrival: {!
// the generic close: used when the writer of a congress did not write their own
Q.sys_cg_walkout_lost = (Q.congress_walkout && !Q.congress_won) ? 1 : 0;
Q.sys_cg_was_lead = Q.congress_backing_is_lead;
RG.congress.end();
!}

= [+ congress_name +]: the Vote

The debate is over. The delegates vote by show of mandate cards, district by district, while the tellers count. At stake: [+ congress_stake +].

The motion of the **[+ congress_result_name +]** is carried. [? if congress_won = 1 : It is ours: [+ congress_votes_for +]% of the delegates voted with us. ?][? if congress_won = 0 : It is not ours: we had [+ congress_votes_for +]% of the delegates. ?] [? if congress_close_call = 1 : It was very close. ?]

[? if congress_leadership_changed = 1 : The new Zentrale is elected on the last evening. The [+ congress_result_name +] hold it now, and the party line is theirs. ?][? if congress_won = 1 and congress_has_deal = 1 : The current that voted with us takes its seats in the Zentrale, as promised. ?][? if sys_cg_walkout_lost = 1 : We threatened to walk out if we lost. The delegates are waiting to see if we meant it. ?]

- @magnanimous: Offer the losers places on the commissions.
- @press_home: Press home the victory.
- @accept: Accept the verdict of the congress.
- @walk_out: Carry out the threat: our delegates leave the hall.
- @swallow: Swallow it, and stay.

@magnanimous
subtitle: The losers are reconciled, a little.
view-if: congress_won = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.unity += 5;
for (var f of Q.congress_positions) {
    if (f != Q.congress_result && Q[f + '_satisfaction'] !== undefined) {
        Q[f + '_satisfaction'] += 6;
    }
}
!}

The beaten minority gets seats on the trade union commission and the editorial board. Nobody is grateful, but nobody leaves.

@press_home
subtitle: The line is ours, and we use it. The losers suffer.
view-if: congress_won = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q['lean_' + Q.congress_result] += 2;
for (var f of Q.congress_positions) {
    if (f != Q.congress_result && Q[f + '_satisfaction'] !== undefined) {
        Q[f + '_satisfaction'] -= 8;
    }
}
Q.unity -= 4;
!}

The congress resolution is printed in full on the front page of the Rote Fahne, with the names of those who voted against it underneath.

@accept
subtitle: The party respects a Zentrale that respects the congress.
view-if: congress_won = 0 and sys_cg_walkout_lost = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.unity += 3;
Q[Q.congress_result + '_satisfaction'] += 3;
!}

We accept the decision and say so from the platform. The congress ends with the Internationale, sung by everybody, more or less in tune.

@walk_out
subtitle: Our delegates leave with us. The party may not recover from it.
view-if: sys_cg_walkout_lost = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.unity -= 15;
Q[Q.congress_result + '_satisfaction'] -= 20;
Q[Q.congress_backing + '_satisfaction'] += 8;
if (Q.congress_leadership_changed && Q.congress_old_leader == Q.congress_backing) {
    // the new majority rules the hall, but our delegates hold the Zentrale's districts
    Q.leading_faction = Q.congress_old_leader;
    Q.junior_faction = 0;
}
RG.ledger('Our delegates walked out of ' + Q.congress_name + '.', 'walkout_' + Q.time);
!}

Our delegates stand up together and walk out of the hall. The congress goes on without them, and elects a Zentrale that half the districts do not recognise. In the morning, there are two leaderships, two sets of instructions and one party, for now.

@swallow
subtitle: We stay. Our own current will not forgive the climbdown.
view-if: sys_cg_walkout_lost = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.congress_backing + '_satisfaction'] -= 12;
Q.unity -= 3;
!}

We stay in our seats. The [+ congress_result_name +] make sure everybody noticed.
